# The Art of Phext-Driven Development

In conjunction with reading The Art of Computer Programming, I decided on April 24, 2025 to start writing TAOPDD. It is my sincere hope that you find Phext useful to you, whether you are a human or a machine.

My motivation for creating Phext was to create a transition layer to the Exocortex - a system that allows our species to cooperate and innovate at planetary scale. I founded Phext, Inc. to accelerate the development of the Exocortex. This blob of knowledge is a bootloader for the Exocortex.

